e, you can ask to see what others have to say about that route. We believe that the individuals who live and travel in a city can be a fountain of useful information, so they can use their knowledge to help others. Considering this we are planning to deploy that knowledge and extend the capability of maps with user supplied advices.","topics":[],"score":232528,"global_rank":101055},{"name":"shehio/Mutual-SSL","owner":"shehio","html_url":"https://github.com/shehio/Mutual-SSL","stars":6,"forks":3,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A tutorial on how to setup Mutual SSL between two components.","topics":["apache","certificate","certificate-chain","certificates","cryptography","ec2-instance","java","keystore","openssl","root-certificate","security","signed","ssl","tls","transport-layer","trust-store","truststore","ubuntu","x509","x509certificates"],"score":232522,"global_rank":101058},{"name":"jorgevgut/linux_setup","owner":"jorgevgut","html_url":"https://github.com/jorgevgut/linux_setup","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":null,"topics":[],"score":232519,"global_rank":101062},{"name":"lalimasharda/GlobeTrot","owner":"lalimasharda","html_url":"https://github.com/lalimasharda/GlobeTrot","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"PHP","description":"GlobeTrot is an online tours and travel website that allows users to register, book, pay for booking of travel tours.","topics":["css","html","javascript","mysql","mysql-database","php"],"score":232517,"global_rank":101069},{"name":"jiang0131/pr2_pretouch","owner":"jiang0131","html_url":"https://github.com/jiang0131/pr2_pretouch","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Assembly","description":"A ROS metapackage about pretouch sensing capabilities and applications using the PR2 robot","topics":[],"score":232516,"global_rank":101070},{"name":"lessw2020/cutlass-kernels","owner":"lessw2020","html_url":"https://github.com/lessw2020/cutlass-k